{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Gear Mong Kok</strong> is a fast-paced action game that combines hack-and-slash with shooting mechanics. Unleash stylish combos and take on uniquely designed enemies\u2014beat them to a pulp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/\u65e0\u6807\u9898\u89c6\u9891\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c__1_.gif?t=1742956929\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a future Hong Kong taken over by rogue machines after an alien fortress invasion, Kate is frustrated that she can't buy cigarettes. Armed with her transformable high-tech weapon, &quot;Double Cigarettes,&quot; and her cigarette-box-shaped mechanical assistant, she fights back against the alien stronghold!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smooth Action Combat -\u00a0</strong>Unleash stylish ground and aerial combos on your enemies!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Specialized Bullets -</strong> Each with unique effects to take down enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A diverse variety of skill combinations!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge massive bosses in epic battles!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/Skills.gif?t=1742956929\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539360?t=1742956929","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/9dd00f3f844a16cd92a4cadab645ee0c58b002fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742956929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_